"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Naming (ADR-0010): helpers are named after the Origami "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"patch"}]},{"type":"text","text":", bare (no prefix) —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"disambiguate with the module ("},{"code":"OrigamiPatterns.Interaction","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") if it ever collides. This one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doesn’t clash with anything in SwiftUI."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Exposes the Interaction patch’s output ports as bindings\/callbacks so downstream SwiftUI","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"composes off them, matching the graph:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"down"},{"text":" — ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" while a finger is on the layer,","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"position"},{"type":"text","text":" — the touch point, in the layer’s coordinate space,"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"onTap","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"onDoubleTap","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"onLongPress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — discrete pulses.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only the gesture for an output you actually request is attached — so a tap-only layer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carries only a tap recognizer (no stray drag), which keeps gesture arbitration clean."}]}]}],"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction/ViewModifier-Implementations":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Inte